# Notes on the FX track set the interval while a sine at 330 Hz plays into a long, bright shimmer: C4 (an octave,
# the default), G3 (a fifth), C5 (two octaves), C2 (an octave down), F3 (a fourth), C3 (unison: shimmer off), then
# C4 again. The interval stays after each note's release.
tempo 120
steps 64
tail 3
track fx2
input sine 330 0.4
preset 190 190 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 8 G3 2 100
note 16 C5 2 100
note 24 C2 2 100
note 32 F3 2 100
note 40 C3 2 100
note 48 C4 2 100
gain 1
expect sound 0 64
expect peak_below -3
